&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;About Vercel:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Vercel is the agentic infrastructure company, freeing people and agents to ship what&#39;s next. For more than a decade we&#39;ve helped builders move from idea to production with speed, security, and exceptional developer experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Now we&#39;re scaling our products for both agents and people to ship and run software, built in the open and trusted by OpenAI, PayPal, Ramp, Supreme, and millions of developers worldwide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vercel is growing fast, and so is the demand on our IT team. We&#39;re looking for an IT Operations Engineer to be the backbone of day-to-day technical support for our New York City office, someone who takes real ownership of the employee experience and keeps our team running at full speed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you&#39;ll be the go-to person for in-office IT support: resolving hardware and software issues and partnering with teams across the company to make sure everyone has what they need to do their best work. You&#39;ll manage the tools and systems Vercel&#39;s employees rely on every day, from endpoint management and AV to onboarding workflows and access controls.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;AI fluency is a core expectation at Vercel, not a bonus. We expect you to actively use AI tools to work faster, automate repetitive tasks, and solve problems more effectively. Whether that&#39;s writing scripts, drafting documentation, triaging requests, or researching solutions, we want someone who reaches for AI as a natural part of how they work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Beyond the helpdesk, you&#39;ll have genuine opportunities to contribute to larger IT projects and initiatives. This is a team that operates with a high bar and moves quickly, and we&#39;re looking for someone who matches that energy: proactive, detail-oriented, and genuinely excited about building great IT experiences at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This is an in-person role based in New York City. &lt;/strong&gt;The successful candidate will be expected to work onsite to effectively collaborate with our team and support our office&#39;s IT needs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the first point of contact for in-office and remote staff on all IT-related issues. Troubleshoot and resolve hardware, software, and network problems, ensuring minimal downtime and a great employee experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Actively use AI tools to triage requests, draft documentation, write scripts, and find solutions faster. We expect AI to be a regular part of how you work, not an occasional experiment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilize IT ticketing systems to manage and prioritize help-desk requests, keeping response times tight and communication clear.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help with the creation, management, and support of user accounts and access controls, ensuring employees have the resources and permissions they need to do their jobs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support in-office AV and conference room technology, including event support for team gatherings and all-hands meetings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with other IT team members on projects ranging from new technology rollouts to process improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with our Onboarding team to procure equipment, set up accounts, and deliver a smooth experience for new hires.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain clear documentation for IT systems, processes, and common issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work cross-functionally with teams like Workplace Services and People to support company-wide initiatives and keep the office running well.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experienced IT Professional:&lt;/strong&gt; You have at least 5 years of experience in IT support or a related field, with a solid foundation in troubleshooting hardware, software, AV, and network issues. Experience in a startup or tech environment is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI-Native Worker:&lt;/strong&gt; You actively use AI tools as a core part of how you work, not just occasionally. You reach for them to move faster, automate repetitive tasks, write scripts, draft docs, and solve problems more effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tech-Savvy Problem Solver:&lt;/strong&gt; You have a strong understanding of macOS environments, networking, and security, and you&#39;re known for diagnosing and resolving technical issues quickly and thoroughly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Effective Communicator:&lt;/strong&gt; You can explain complex technical issues in plain language and work collaboratively across teams and departments with ease.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proactive and Adaptable:&lt;/strong&gt; You thrive in fast-paced environments, take initiative without being asked, and can juggle multiple tasks or priorities without dropping the ball.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Service-Oriented:&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;re approachable, patient, and genuinely enjoy helping people. You treat every support interaction as an opportunity to leave someone better off than you found them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Detail-Oriented:&lt;/strong&gt; You manage your work and documentation carefully, keep IT assets organized, and don&#39;t let things fall through the cracks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Security Conscious:&lt;/strong&gt; You understand the importance of cybersecurity and are proactive about implementing measures to protect company data and systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Continuous Learner:&lt;/strong&gt; You stay current on IT trends and best practices and are motivated to grow your skills alongside the team and the company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation &amp;amp; Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Great compensation package and stock options.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Inclusive Healthcare Package.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learn and Grow - we provide mentorship and send you to events that help you build your network and skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible Time Off - Flexible vacation policy with a recommended 4-weeks per year, and paid holidays.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We will provide you the gear you need to do your role, and a stipend to refresh your tech gear as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The base pay range for this role is $116,000-$174,000. This salary range is an estimate. Actual salary will be based on job related skills and experience.&amp;nbsp; The total compensation package also includes benefits and equity-based compensation.&lt;/p&gt;
