&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ve shipped something technical enough that engineers treated you as a peer. You can read a trace waterfall and reason about cardinality, sampling, and retention costs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable owning a domain end to end without a PM above you translating strategy into work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You use the products you build on, and you have opinions about the ones you don&#39;t.&lt;/li&gt;
