&lt;li&gt;Kick off sales cycles by identifying and qualifying future customers in assigned geo and Enterprise market segment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write tailored messages and cold call qualified prospects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set and book qualified meetings for Enterprise AEs&lt;/li&gt;
