&lt;li&gt;Have marketed directly to developer communities or run technical content programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have launched campaigns supporting AI, cloud, or infrastructure products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have worked in both high-growth startups and large-scale enterprise organizations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
