&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy: &lt;/strong&gt;Please review our J&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;ob Applicant Privacy Policy&lt;/span&gt; for more information on how we handle your data.&lt;/li&gt;
