&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;text-copy-16 text-gray-900 [&amp;amp;_b]:text-gray-1000 my-6 [&amp;amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;amp;_i]:not-italic&quot;&gt;The San Francisco, CA base pay range for this role is $190,000 - $258,000. Actual salary will be based on job-related skills, experience, and location. Compensation outside of San Francisco may be adjusted based on employee location. The total compensation package may include benefits, equity-based compensation, and eligibility for a company bonus or variable pay program depending on the role. Your recruiter can share more details during the hiring process.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Disclosures:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
